Indie game developers from around the world with unpublished titles are being invited to enter the Indie Stars competition for a chance to showcase their games at Game Republic New Horizons.&nbsp;

Up to 10 games will be selected by a panel of games media and will feature in the Indie Stars expo at Middlesbrough&rsquo;s Riverside Stadium on October 15th.&nbsp; ... [<a href="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/indie-stars-competition-launches-for-game-republic-new-horizons/">MORE</a>]
